VehicleSequenceViews::startVehicleView - sequence rendering (view def SequenceView)

part driver
  perform turnVehicleOn
  perform trigger2
  event occurrence driverReady
part vehicle
  perform trigger1
  perform sendStatus
  event occurrence doorClosed

messages:
  driver.turnVehicleOn -> vehicle.trigger1: of ignitionCmd : IgnitionCmd
  vehicle.sendStatus -> driver.trigger2: of es : EngineStatus
  vehicle.doorClosed -> driver.driverReady

not represented:
  - the flows in perform action startVehicle are its action flow, not interaction messages; they are not shown
